WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.2 · Strategic Foundations
Context and landscape analysis

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Look outward at the landscape before you commit time, savings or a legal form.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:25.541
Context analysis is a short, honest picture of the world your idea will enter: who has the problem, how they solve it today and what is changing around them.

4
00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:26.541
Three ways to look

5
00:00:26.541 --> 00:00:38.981
Who is already active: Businesses, public services, nonprofits, informal groups and the “do nothing” option people use today. For example: A tutoring idea finds two paid tutors, a free library homework club and parents helping.

6
00:00:38.981 --> 00:00:48.830
PESTLE scan: Six outside factors: political, economic, social, technological, legal and environmental. For example: Economic: rising prices mean more families repair appliances instead of buying new.

7
00:00:48.830 --> 00:01:01.730
SWOT analysis: Your strengths and weaknesses inside, set against the opportunities and threats outside. For example: Strength: a co-founder trained as an electrician. Threat: the hall we hoped for may close.

8
00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:02.730
Why it matters

9
00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:06.922
1. Competitors and alternatives prove the need exists.

10
00:01:06.922 --> 00:01:12.596
2. You find the gap others leave, or an effort worth joining.

11
00:01:12.596 --> 00:01:19.270
3. Prices, rules and habits can open a door or close one.

12
00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:20.270
What it informs

13
00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:24.833
1. Your purpose, positioning and objectives in this module.

14
00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:29.767
2. The assumptions and risks in your Theory of Change.

15
00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:36.070
3. A fresh look before registering, launching, pricing or first funding.

16
00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:37.070
What to avoid

17
00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:42.004
Points with no source, not even your own conversations.

18
00:01:42.004 --> 00:01:47.307
Listing factors without saying what they mean for your idea.

19
00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:52.870
Ignoring the option of joining an existing effort.

20
00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.270
You write a context scan and a list of the main actors.

21
00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:59.270
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

22
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.870
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
